      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 1r (first section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>[ ... ... ] and he brought him before them.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[ ... ... they sa]id: &ldquo;What is your nation?&rdquo; He said:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;[I am a Jew?], but I am a child of fornication.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[They said: &ldquo;What is the name of] your father?&rdquo; He said: &ldquo;His name is Pandera</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and he is a foreigner.&rdquo; &ldquo;And what is the name of your mother?&rdquo; He said:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;Her name is Miriam.&rdquo; &ldquo;And what is her profession?&rdquo; He said: &ldquo;Hair-dresser.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>They said: &ldquo;Your mother&rsquo;s husband&mdash;what is his name?&rdquo; He said: &ldquo;Pappos.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;And what is his profession?&rdquo; He said: &ldquo;A carpenter.&rdquo; &ldquo;And you&mdash;what is your name?&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;He said: &ldquo;My name is Yesu\u02bfa.&rdquo; &ldquo;And what is your profession?&rdquo; He said: &ldquo;a fisherman.&rdquo;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
